  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/ironjetpacks?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></span></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fironjetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fironjetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鐵製噴射背包是一款現代化的噴射背包模組，功能豐富且易於使用。</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>特色</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全自訂化！所有噴射背包的數值和屬性都可透過設定調整，您還能自行新增！ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fironjetpacks%252fjetpack-json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(文件)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">內建一組預設噴射背包，由各種原版與模組材料製作而成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用FE（Forge Energy）作為能量來源，確保廣泛的模組相容性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">油門控制！可即時調整空中移動速度！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過內建HUD介面，即時查看當前能量、引擎、滯空及油門狀態。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>全新！</strong>支援Curios飾品欄！可將噴射背包裝備於Curios飾品欄位。</span></li>\n</ul>",
